          "age": "1989",
          "atopy": false,
          "badText": "Texture/viscosity \nThis is a very thick cream, and I find it takes some effort to melt it down.\n\nMy experience \nMy sensitive skin seems unsure about this product. There are times when I can use it with little to no increase in redness, and there are times when it does seems to cause a significant amount of redness. It seems to be related to how often I use it, how much I use at a time, the general condition of my skin at that time and the other products that I use it with. \n\nI recommend it for…\nI recommend this product for people with drier, less sensitive skin types. It may be suitable for people with less dry skin in colder weather, especially during winter.",
          "blind": 0,
          "brand": "디어,클레어스 (dear,klairs)",
